Z||000033||DecadenceR||08-05-2001||01:03 PM||||Well first I thought it was pretty good. I laughed at Heston's "Damn them all to hell..." line. Of course they had to fit it in there. I did notice that in the Lincolon memorial, behind the statue, that it says it's for thanks og the general in the war. I didnt' read exactly what it said, I should have paused it to see. i can do that today. But it seems like the ape did find a way back to earth but went back in time a pretty large cuhnk of time. That or one of the apes that originally crashed in Marky Makrs ship found a way to get back to earth. because they said there was thousands of years since it had crashed, and they said that the apes on board were getting smarter and they were having a hard time fighting them off. I'll have to go back and look at the name on the wall though.||||reg||1
